Print All Substrings of a String

Given a string S, print all possible substrings of the string in the order they are generated.

A substring is a continuous part of a string.

After printing all substrings, print the total number of substrings.

Input Format

A single string S

Constraints

1 <= S.length() <= 100

Output Format

Print all substrings line by line. * In the last line, print:

`text Total Substrings = count

Sample Input 0

text
ab
Sample Output 0

t
te
tex
text
e
ex
ext
x
xt
t
Total Substrings = 10
Sample Input 1

text
dog
Sample Output 1

t
te
tex
text
e
ex
ext
x
xt
t
Total Substrings = 10
